#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Mapep"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Uri fejn jinsabu l-kumpaniji fuq mappa, billi kull indirizz postali jitqiegħed offline fil-kodiċi postali jew fil-belt tiegħu minn tabelli miżmuma fuq dan is-server, jew fejn tpoġġih int bl-idejn; l-indirizz ta' kuntatt u dak tiegħek jitfasslu biss meta titlob, u l-punti tagħhom jinżammu magħhom u jitħassru magħhom. Il-mappa titfassal minn Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) fuq it-tiles ta' OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) sakemm is-Settings ma jagħżlux tiles oħra jew xejn; OpenStreetMap imbagħad isir jaf l-indirizz ta' kull min qed jara u l-inħawi li qed iħares lejhom. Il-postijiet ġejjin minn GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; il-kodiċijiet postali tiegħu CC BY 4.0), l-ismijiet tal-pajjiżi mill-Unicode CLDR permezz ta' Babel, u l-kontorn tad-dinja minn Natural Earth (dominju pubbliku). Mitfi, ma hemm l-ebda paġna tal-mappa u l-ebda indirizz ma jitqiegħed; il-koordinati diġà maħżuna jibqgħu reġistrati u jerġgħu lura mhux mimsusa meta jerġa' jinxtegħel."
